extends ../../base-email

block content
  tr
    td(style="padding: 40px 40px 32px;")
      // Illustration
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 32px; width: 100%;")
        tr
          td(align="center" style="padding-bottom: 32px;")
            // Hackathon illustration
            div(style="font-size: 80px; line-height: 1; color: #202124;") 🚀
      
      // Heading
      h1(style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 32px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Hackathons Happening This Week
      
      // Main message
      p(style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Exciting hackathons are starting this week! Don't miss out on these incredible opportunities to showcase your skills, collaborate with talented developers, and win amazing prizes.
      
      // Hackathons List Section
      if hackathons && hackathons.length > 0
        p(style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Featured Hackathons:
        
        each hackathon in hackathons
          table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #F8F9FA;")
            tr
              td(style="padding: 20px;")
                // Hackathon Name
                h2(style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")= hackathon.name || 'Hackathon'
                
                // Hackathon Description
                if hackathon.description
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")= hackathon.description
                
                // Hackathon Details
                table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 16px; width: 100%;")
                  if hackathon.settings && hackathon.settings.startDate
                    tr
                      td(style="padding: 4px 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
                        span(style="font-weight: 500; color: #202124;") Start Date:&nbsp;
                        = hackathon.settings.startDate
                        if hackathon.settings.startTime
                          | &nbsp;at&nbsp;
                          = hackathon.settings.startTime
                  if hackathon.type
                    tr
                      td(style="padding: 4px 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
                        span(style="font-weight: 500; color: #202124;") Type:&nbsp;
                        = hackathon.type
                
                // CTA Button
                table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 16px 0 0;")
                  tr
                    td
                      a(href=(hackathonLink || "#") + "/" + (hackathon.slug || hackathon.code || hackathon.id) style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 24px; background-color: #1A73E8; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") View Hackathon
      else
        p(style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
          | Check back soon for upcoming hackathons! We're always adding new opportunities for you to showcase your talents.
      
      // CTA Section
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Ready to participate? Browse all hackathons and find the perfect challenge for you.
      
      // CTA Button
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 24px 0 32px;")
        tr
          td
            a(href=allHackathonsLink || "#" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 24px; background-color: #1A73E8; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Browse All Hackathons
      
      // Closing
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Happy hacking!
        br
        span(style="font-weight: 500;") The Pacepard Team
